# Uvavanyo lweVulkan kwiLinux
app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: akukho silayishi seVulkan kule nkqubo, ngoko akukho nto yokuzoba ngayo.\n\nISchist izoba isebenzisa iVulkan, kwaye i-`libvulkan.so.1` ayifakwanga.\nKufuneka isilayishi nomqhubi zombini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: umqhubi weVulkan owalathwa yile seshoni akakho.\n\nI-{var} isetiwe, kwaye ukuyiseta *kuthatha indawo* yokukhangela kwesiLayishi\nabaqhubi endaweni yokongeza kuko. Ngoko ezi fayile zingekhoyo\nluluhlu olupheleleyo lwabaqhubi—kwaye yonke inkqubo yeVulkan kule seshoni\nayiboni kwaphela umqhubi, nokuba bangaphi abafakiweyo:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYalathise kwifayile ye-manifest ekhoyo—abaqhubi abafakiweyo babeka ezabo\nkwi-/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d—okanye susa le sethingi uvumele isilayishi sizifunele.\nIseshoni efumana oku kwifayile yoqwalaselo (i-`env =` yeHyprland,\nifayile ye-systemd environment.d, okanye iprofayile ye-shell) kufuneka ilungiswe apho,\nkwaye olo tshintsho lufuna ukungena ngokutsha ukuze lufikelele kwizinto esele zisebenza.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nI-{var} isetelwe ku-{value}, kwaye oko kuthatha indawo yokukhangela\nkwesiLayishi: ukuba akukho nanye kwezo manifest eyenzelwe lo matshini, inyathelo\nlokuqala ongalizama kukuyisusa loo sethingi.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: akukho mqhubi weVulkan ufakiweyo, ngoko akukho nto yokuzoba kuyo.\n\nISchist izoba isebenzisa iVulkan. Isilayishi sifakiwe kodwa sixela ukuba akukho\nmqhubi—akukho nto ibhalise umqhubi nakweyiphi kwezi ndawo zimbini kukhangelwa kuzo:\n\n{dirs}\n\nIsilayishi sifakwa ngokwahlukileyo kubaqhubi, ngoko oku kudla ngokuba\nyiphakheji enye engekhoyo.\n\nFaka elungiselelwe i-GPU yalo matshini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nUmqhubi wobumnini weNVIDIA uza nowawo (`nvidia-utils` kwiArch,\n`nvidia-driver` kwiDebian). Kumatshini wenyani, okanye naphi na apho kungekho\nmqhubi weGPU unokufakwa, isirasterayiza sesoftwe sesona sisebenzayo:\n`vulkan-swrast` kwiArch, siyinxalenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers` kwezinye iinkqubo.\nSiyacotha, kodwa siyaqalisa.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: umqhubi weVulkan ufakiwe kodwa akaniki sixhobo sokuzoba kuso.\n\nKusenokwenzeka ukuba umqhubi akayixhasi le GPU, okanye akakwazi ukufikelela kuyo—\nngokusebenzisa iSSH, okanye ngaphakathi kwekhonteyina, ukungabikho kwe-/dev/dri yingxaki\neqhelekileyo. I-`vulkaninfo --summary` ixela oko kubonwa sisilayishi.\n\nIsirasterayiza sesoftwe sizoba ngaphandle kweGPU, ukuba lo matshini unjalo:\n`vulkan-swrast` kwiArch, siyinxalenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nkwiDebian nakwiFedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ukuqalisa iSchist nokuba kunjalo uze uyiyeke isilele ngendlela yayo, seta {var}=1.
